\n$$\n\nNote that $T$ and $N$ denote the unit tangent and principal normal, respectively." 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386027 1072 #uuid "0afd69e0-1da5-5a6a-895c-0f0f5cbf2711" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386027 1074 "First, notice that the position vector of the point $P(-1,0,1)$ is $r(\\pi )=-i+\\,k.$\n\nThe osculating plane passes through the point that is at the tip of the vector $r(1).$ The vectors $T(1)$ and $N(1)$ are parallel to this plane. Therefore, the equation of the plane (in parametric form) can be written as\n\n$$\nR(s,u)=r(\\pi )+s\\,T(\\pi )+u\\,N(\\pi ),\\,s,u\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ).\n$$\n\n \n\nHence, the equation of the osculating plane at the point $(-1,0,1)$ is given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}R(s,u) & =r(\\pi )+s\\,T(\\pi )+u\\,N(\\pi ) \\\\  & =(-i+\\,k)+s(\\frac{3}{5}\\,i-\\frac{4}{5}k)+u(-\\,j) \\\\  & =(-1+\\frac{3}{5}s)\\,i-u\\,j+(1-\\frac{4}{5}s)\\,k.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386028 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386029 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386028 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386030 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386028 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386031 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386028 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386032 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386028 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386033 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386028 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386028 1077 "selection" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386028 1079 #edb/ref 17592186386029 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386028 1080 #uuid "1aefb939-f80c-517f-8459-04195e8fbb29" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386029 1081 "R(s,u)=(-1+\\frac{3}{5}s)\\,i-u\\,j+(1-\\frac{4}{5}s)\\,k" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386029 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386029 1084 #uuid "734a6a1e-e685-50e7-b883-a6ebf4635869" 13194139533462 1