uuid "d899d29b-8ceb-54bb-99b6-823abccec15f" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386083 1074 "First, we find ${r}^{′}(t)$ and its magnitude $‖{r}^{′}(t)‖:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{r}^{′}(t) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(\\operatorname{cos}⁡({t}^{4}))i+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(\\operatorname{sin}⁡({t}^{4}))j \\\\  & =-4{t}^{3}\\operatorname{sin}⁡({t}^{4})\\,i+4{t}^{3}\\operatorname{cos}⁡({t}^{4})\\,j \\\\ ‖{r}^{′}(t)‖ & =\\sqrt{{[-4{t}^{3}\\operatorname{sin}⁡({t}^{4})]}^{2}+{[4{t}^{3}\\operatorname{cos}⁡({t}^{4})]}^{2}} \\\\  & =4|t{|}^{3}\\sqrt{{sin}^{2}⁡({t}^{4})+{cos}^{2}⁡({t}^{4})} \\\\  & =4{t}^{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNext, we calculate the arc length of the curve from $0$ to $t:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}s & ={\\int }_{0}^{t}‖{r}^{′}(u)‖\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{t}4{u}^{3}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & ={u}^{4}\\,{|}_{0}^{t} \\\\  & ={t}^{4}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n  \n\nNow, since $s={t}^{4}$, we have that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{t}^{4} & =s \\\\ t & =\\sqrt[4]{s}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the vector function that parametrizes $r(t)$ by its arc length is given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}R(s) & =r(\\sqrt[4]{s}) \\\\  & =cos\\,((\\sqrt[4]{s})^{4})\\,i+sin\\,((\\sqrt[4]{s})^{4})\\,j \\\\  & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡(s)\\,i+\\operatorname{sin}⁡(s)\\,j.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386084 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386085 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386084 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386086 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386084 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386087 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386084 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386088 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386084 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386089 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386084 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386084 1077 "selection" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386084 1079 #edb/ref 17592186386088 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386084 10