,d.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince $B$ is not singular, it must have an inverse ${B}^{-1}.$ Now, pre-multiplying both sides of the equation $B\\,x=A\\,d$ by ${B}^{-1},$ we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}B\\,x & =A\\,d \\\\ {B}^{-1}B\\,x & ={B}^{-1}A\\,d \\\\ {I}_{6}\\,x & ={B}^{-1}A\\,d \\\\ x & ={B}^{-1}A\\,d.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386140 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386141 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386140 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386142 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386140 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386143 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386140 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386144 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386140 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386145 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386140 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386140 1077 "selection" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386140 1079 #edb/ref 17592186386144 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386140 1080 #uuid "949387db-f0bb-576c-92cd-6be88553f987" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386141 1081 "x=A\\,d\\,{B}^{-1}" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386141 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386141 1084 #uuid "f188d035-264a-5a84-960f-7777553b0e05" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386142 1081 "x=BA\\,d" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386142 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386142 1084 #uuid "e9b99b9b-8aea-5b21-b666-f2b5972647d5" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386143 1081 "x=A{B}^{-1}\\,d" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386143 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386143 1084 #uuid "03b50807-020a-5cac-b35c-77e42daa0304" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386144 1081 "x={B}^{-1}A\\,d" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386144 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 131941395