⁡0 \\\\ x & ={90}^{∘}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince this value lies inside the desired domain, our first solution is ${x}_{1}={90}^{∘}.$\n\nTo find more solutions, we subtract integer multiples of ${180}^{∘}$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{2} & ={x}_{1}-{180}^{∘} \\\\  & ={90}^{∘}-{180}^{∘} \\\\  & =-{90}^{∘}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, our solutions are $x=-{90}^{∘},{90}^{∘}.$\n\nFinally, the numerical value of ${x}_{1}\\cdot {x}_{2}$ is \n\n$$\n90\\cdot (-90)=-8\\,100.\n$$" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386231 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386232 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386231 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386233 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386231 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386234 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386231 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386235 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386231 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386236 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386231 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386231 1077 "selection" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386231 1079 #edb/ref 17592186386233 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386231 1080 #uuid "ec419c65-67ca-5aa8-82ad-a2c9fe852709" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386232 1081 "32\\,400" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386232 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386232 1084 #uuid "4b5b028d-56fd-576d-89ee-59e91162f77f" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386233 1081 "-8\\,100" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386233 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386233 1084 #uuid "dabad841-65b9-5a99-92af-ee6af4b2bb9f" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386234 1081 "-16\\,200" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386234 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386234 1084 #uuid "b4b7bd2e-cf2b-501c-a930-f8e0d6c3c9b3" 13194139533462 175921860