the $1$st one). Thus, ${x}_{2}$ is a free variable. \n\nFrom the first equation, we obtain \n\n$$\n-6{x}_{1}-6{x}_{2}=0\\,⟹\\,{x}_{1}=-{x}_{2}.\n$$\n\nHence, the general solution is\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}-{x}_{2} \\\\ {x}_{2}\\end{aligned}],\\,{x}_{2}\\in R.\n$$\n\nFinally, setting ${x}_{2}=1,$ we get the eigenvector \n\n$$\nv=[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}].\n$$" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386238 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386239 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386238 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386240 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386238 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386241 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386238 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386242 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386238 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386243 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386238 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386238 1077 "selection" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386238 1079 #edb/ref 17592186386241 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386238 1080 #uuid "6dc5d1e1-a9ac-55f4-97d3-5950006030fc" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386239 1081 "[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}]" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386239 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386239 1084 #uuid "c57b3f88-81ed-58c4-9f8a-e3ad55ab73c7" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386240 1081 "[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386240 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386240 1084 #uuid "09c64718-21b5-5183-bfa9-c8d620351a27" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386241 1081 "[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386241 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386241 1084 #uuid "11ba0d00-edd1-5efe-9ef6-92af724df99d" 13194139533462 17592186045585 tr