186386271 1068 #edb/ref 17592186386272 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386271 1069 "q-80660" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386271 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386271 1071 "![](images/93/939f859ef3454e31a9adaae7d72210ef670f93cbf3d77ecf87aa3879d8d0644c.png)\n\nConsider the region $R$ shown above. Let the function $f(x,y)$ be defined as\n\n$$\nf(x,y)={\\begin{aligned}0, & (x,y)\\in S, \\\\ \\frac{x}{1+{y}^{2}}, & (x,y)\\in T, \\\\ \\frac{y}{1+{x}^{2}}, & (x,y)\\in U.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen,\n\n$$\n{∬}_{R}f(x,y)\\text{ }\\text{d}A=\n$$" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386271 1072 #uuid "eea6b611-00bb-5f83-baaa-40b71dbd134d" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386271 1074 "First, notice that the domain $R$ can be represented as a union of three sub-domains, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}R & =S\\cup T\\cup U.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, we can write\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{R}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}A & ={∬}_{S}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}A+{∬}_{T}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}A+{∬}_{U}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={∬}_{S}0\\,\\text{d}A+{∬}_{T}\\frac{x}{1+{y}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}A+{∬}_{U}\\frac{y}{1+{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={∬}_{T}\\frac{x}{1+{y}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}A+{∬}_{U}\\frac{y}{1+{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}A.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386272 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386273 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386272 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386274 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386272 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386275 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386272 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386276 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386272 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386277 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386272 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386272 1077 "selection" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386272 1079 #edb/ref 17592186386273 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386272 1080 #uuid "4beae462-077c-50dc-bbd5-cdbddadf6d7f" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386273 1081 "{∬}_{T}\\frac{x}{1+{y}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}A+{∬}_{U}\\frac{y}{1+{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}A" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386273 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386273 1084 #uuid "f02ea045-7938-5ad8-a10c-30a704b8dda1" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386274 1081 "{∬}_{T\\cup U}\\frac{x+y}{1+{y}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}A" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386274 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386274 1084 #uuid "128daf17-f1c9-5bd4-98fd-c106cd31538f" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386275 1081 "{∬}_{S}x\\,\\text{d}A+{∬}_{T}\\frac{x}{1+{y}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}A+{∬}_{U}\\frac{y}{1+{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}A" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386275 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386275 1084 #uuid "21bd2652-bdbe-5881-b93c-c97a4cb950c8" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386276 1081 "{∬}_{T}\\frac{x+y}{1+{y}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}A" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386276 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386276 1084 #uuid "4adc4e65-f1bf-5fe5-828f-a800e29bd3e1" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386277 1081 "{∬}_{T\\cup U}\\frac{x+y}{1+{x}^{2}{y}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}A" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386277 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386277 1084 #uuid "7a9375b6-7e86-5c09-a058-1b0b2c35140e" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386278 1068 #edb/ref 17592186386279 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386278 1069 "q-80671" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386278 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386278 1071 "Consider the linear transformation $T:[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]⟶[\\begin{aligned}3x+y+3z \\\\ 2x+y+z \\\\ x-y+5z\\end{aligned}]$ and the vector $\\,u=[\\begin{aligned}-2 \\\\ 3 \\\\ k\\end{aligned}].$ Find the value of $\\,k\\,$ such that $\\,u\\in \\text{Ker}(T).$" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386278 1072 #uuid "a4dce28d-b322-5c7f-88fd-a0c01e48564e" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386278 1074 "A vector $u$ belongs to the kernel of a linear transformation $T$ if $T(u)=0.$ \n\nSo, we need to solve the following equation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}T(u) & =0 \\\\ [\\begin{aligned}3\\cdot (-2)+3+3\\cdot k \\\\ 2\\cdot (-2)+3+k \\\\ -2-3+5\\cdot k\\end{aligned}] & =[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}] \\\\ [\\begin{aligned}-3+3k \\\\ -1+k \\\\ -5+5k\\end{aligned}] & =[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we get the system\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}-3+3k=0 \\\\ -1+k=0 \\\\ -5+5k=0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe solution to all three of these equations is $k=1.$" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386279 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386280 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386279 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386281 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386279 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386282 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386279 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386283 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386279 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386284 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386279 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386279 1077 "selection" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386279 1079 #edb/ref 17592186386281 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386279 1080 #uuid "92b7acaf-3ad9-5680-910b-7d4f59738910" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386280 1081 "2" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386280 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386280 1084 #uuid "f10884b6-1de6-5d92-bda1-96200aef78a8" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386281 1081 "1" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386281 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386281 1084 #uuid "a2cbfff0-9403-5eeb-ab47-cfb10e097206" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386282 1081 "-1" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386282 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386282 1084 #uuid "17e21db7-2740-54eb-87ab-43f4c7023e23" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386283 1081 "5" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386283 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386283 1084 #uuid "656d0480-66ba-51ee-b9a6-82fc1fbfd015" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386284 1081 "-2" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386284 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386284 1084 #uuid "298f458f-dd8f-56ee-86d2-8a73d3189728" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386285 1068 #edb/ref 17592186386286 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386285 1069 "q-80722" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386285 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045486 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386285 1071 "The fifth-degree Taylor polynomial of $f(x)$ about $x=-2$ is given by\n\n$$\n{P}_{5}(x)=-3+5(x+2)-7(x+2)^{2}+9(x+2)^{3}-11(x+2)^{4}+13(x+2)^{5}.\n$$\n\nWhat is ${f}^{(5)}(-2)?$" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386285 1072 #uuid "0857096a-6a9d-5a2b-a489-d085d352c19a" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386285 1074 "The coefficient of $(x+2)^{5}$ is given by $\\frac{{f}^{(5)}(-2)}{5!}.$ Therefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{{f}^{(5)}(-2)}{5!} & =13 \\\\ \\frac{{f}^{(5)}(-2)}{120} & =13 \\\\ {f}^{(5)}(-2) & =1\\,560.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386286 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386287 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386286 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386288 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386286 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386289 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386286 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386290 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386286 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386291 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386286 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386286 1077 "selection" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386286 1079 #edb/ref 17592186386287 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386286 1080 #uuid "303ca5d2-6f56-5888-a948-198bbe7b80f1" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386287 1081 "1\\,560" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386287 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386287 1084 #uuid "87ce0934-02d4-5393-a820-a60747531d26" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386288 1081 "484" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386288 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386288 1084 #uuid "55151c71-8b6d-58eb-a249-4eb4aac0d349" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386289 1081 "264" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386289 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386289 1084 #uuid "7f1eb3bb-51af-5134-8c24-9eaec350677e" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386290 1081 "312" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386290 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386290 1084 #uuid "2fb5a83c-3187-5ca1-904d-ee6f8e47bd54" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386291 1081 "1\\,320" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386291 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386291 1084 #uuid "11a52e31-0b32-5adb-9e0e-67e9944070c7" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386292 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386293 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386292 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386294 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386292 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386295 13194139533462 17592