mages/72/72c88d1df90c3462d7f1f186c06b9a7acf30c071f5ba8bbf722ee125fee0e616.png)\n\n**Alternative method:**\n\nWe can check that the vertices of $R$ are mapped to the vertices of the rectangle shown above as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}T([\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]) & =[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{3}{2} & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}] \\\\ T([\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]) & =[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{3}{2} & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}] \\\\ T([\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}]) & =[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{3}{2} & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}] \\\\ T([\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}]) & =[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{3}{2} & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386403 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386404 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386403 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386405 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386403 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386406 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386403 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386407 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386403 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386408 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386403 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386403 1077 "selection" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386403 1079 #edb/ref 17592186386407 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386403 1080 #uuid "ebdb8c5b-096b-57f2-b6b3-1e02772f7b4a" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386404 1081 "images/1d/1d25632f24abfc3176f515ba41a763e166d8c9c3101d07732a1efb183a2e9d75.png" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386404 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386404 1084 #uuid "35ad3ac6-648a-5594-bcb1-e1c6cfa23bbd" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386405 1081 "images/a6/a64061e8714d38748ef4907cbdedf873355c64814ef3966d872494e84bcacfbd.png" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386405 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386405 1084 #uuid "222c72ce-1fbf-561c-88e0-10fe8e99adb1" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386406 1081 "images/52/52bb468dfeaae8b4c47cb08a7bb08e671e898467e4130e2e243936b599f51704.png" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386406 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386406 1084 #uuid "25424b64-9590-5703-89ba-952c8395fabf" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386407 1081 "images/6a/6a5da4ecc4dc4cb550649d229f0c7c9d64bd713f901084a937785ea93df86eb1.png" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386407 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386407 1084 #uuid "3cef1ad9-c2db-5b41-9454-daa475d866fa" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386408 1081 "images/9d/9d140b11016d68a8372623e997abdc588633ee02b56a8edee61c8cb269fd4c20.png" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386408 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386408 1084 #uuid "5c5661e2-607d-5c8e-9f4c-71b76bbda105" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386409 1068 #edb/ref 17592186386410 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386409 1069 "q-81435" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386409 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386409 1071 "Given the vector $x$ and the system of linear equations below, find the projection of $x$ onto the solution space of the system.\n\n$$\nx=[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}],\\,{\\begin{aligned}2{x}_{1}-2{x}_{3}=0 \\\\ 4{x}_{1}-4{x}_{3}=0\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386409 1072 #uuid "76b489c8-5c8f-576c-ba37-1623ccf3438d" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386409 1074 "First, we need to find the basis of the solution space of the system.\n\nConsider the augmented matrix $M$ of the system, which we reduce to its row echelon form. Then\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & =[\\begin{aligned}2 & 0 & -2 & 0 \\\\ 4 & 0 & -4 & 0\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}-2{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}2 & 0 & -2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIn the reduced matrix above, there is $1$ pivot column (the $1$st one). Thus, ${x}_{2},\\,{x}_{3}$ are free variables. Now, from the first equation, we get ${x}_{1}={x}_{3}.$ Therefore, the general solution is\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}{x}_{3} \\\\ {x}_{2} \\\\ {x}_{3}\\end{aligned}]={x}_{2}[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]+{x}_{3}[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}],\\,{x}_{2},\\,{x}_{3}\\in R.\n$$\n\nConsequently, $B={[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}],[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]}$ is the basis of the solution space of the system.\n\nNow, we find the orthogonal projection of $x$ onto the solution space of the system:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\text{proj}}_{S}\\,x & =A({A}^{T}\\,A)^{-1}\\,{A}^{T}\\,x \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}0 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]\\cdot {([\\begin{aligned}0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}0 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}])}^{-1}\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}0 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]\\cdot {[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 2\\end{aligned}]}^{-1}\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}0 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}[\\begin{aligned}2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}0 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386410 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386411 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386410 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386412 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386410 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386413 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386410 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386414 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386410 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386415 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386410 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386410 1077 "selection" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386410 1079 #edb/ref 17592186386415 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386410 1080 #uuid "5f57172d-5f9c-5680-8423-f0e6ea5d7ffd" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386411 1081 "[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386411 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386411 1084 #uuid "15dd4b81-6252-5a69-bca0-e1fd124cd255" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386412 1081 "[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}]" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386412 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386412 1084 #uuid "b85664a1-3fab-583f-971d-9811e99660ae" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386413 1081 "[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386413 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386413 1084 #uuid "11f43327-ed18-5f77-aef7-7e1056596fc5" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386414 1081 "[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}]" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386414 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386414 1084 #uuid "6d037ede-ea38-51f8-bb0