6765 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386765 1084 #uuid "3cde2fa1-b566-513c-a5a0-3c64abe2ab15" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386766 1068 #edb/ref 17592186386767 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386766 1069 "q-83649" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386766 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386766 1071 "Given the vector $x$ and the system of linear equations below, find the projection of $x$ onto the solution space of the system.\n\n$$\nx=[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 5\\end{aligned}],\\,{\\begin{aligned}2{x}_{1}-4{x}_{3}=0 \\\\ 6{x}_{1}-12{x}_{3}=0\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386766 1072 #uuid "c652198c-eb51-5ff9-a8db-886e24ee0c6e" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386766 1074 "First, we need to find a basis for the solution space of the system. \n\nConsider the augmented matrix $M$ of the system, which we reduce to row echelon form, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & =[\\begin{aligned}2 & 0 & -4 & 0 \\\\ 6 & 0 & -12 & 0\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}-3{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}2 & 0 & -4 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIn the reduced matrix above, there is $1$ pivot column (the $1$st one). Thus, ${x}_{2},\\,{x}_{3}$ are free variables. Now, from the first equation, we get ${x}_{1}=2{x}_{3}.$ Therefore, the general solution is\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}2{x}_{3} \\\\ {x}_{2} \\\\ {x}_{3}\\end{aligned}]={x}_{2}[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]+{x}_{3}[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}],\\,{x}_{2},\\,{x}_{3}\\in R.\n$$\n\nConsequently, $B={[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}],[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]}$ is the basis of the solution space of the system.\n\nNow, we find the orthogonal projection of $x$ onto the solution space of the system:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\text{proj}}_{S}\\,x & =A({A}^{T}\\,A)^{-1}\\,{A}^{T}\\,x \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}0 & 2 \\\\ 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]\\cdot {([\\begin{aligned}0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 2 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}0 & 2 \\\\ 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}])}^{-1}\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 2 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 5\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}0 & 2 \\\\ 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]\\cdot {[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 5\\end{aligned}]}^{-1}\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 5\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}0 & 2 \\\\ 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]\\cdot \\frac{1}{5}[\\begin{aligned}5 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 5\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}0 & 2 \\\\ 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386767 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386768 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386767 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386769 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386767 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386770 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386767 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386771 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386767 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386772 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386767 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386767 1077 "selection" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386767 1079 #edb/ref 17592186386770 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386767 1080 #uuid "0411b4e3-8abf-58a3-a87a-73efd9a201f1" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386768 1081 "[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}]" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386768 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386768 1084 #uuid "da55d8b9-bcd7-5724-a71a-265e88540b54" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386769 1081 "[\\begin{aligned}0 