585 true] [17592186386826 1068 #edb/ref 17592186386827 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386826 1069 "q-84257" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386826 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386826 1071 "Solve for $x$ in $Ax=b$ given that the matrix $A$ is orthogonal, and \n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{5}} & -\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{5}} & 0 \\\\ \\frac{2}{\\sqrt{5}} & \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{5}} & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}],\\,b=[\\begin{aligned}\\sqrt{5} \\\\ 0 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}].\n$$" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386826 1072 #uuid "5d295ce9-f8cd-5701-932f-c89dd90a82fd" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386826 1074 "The inverse of an orthogonal matrix is equal to its transpose.\n\nHence, since $A$ is orthogonal, we have ${A}^{-1}={A}^{T}.$ Therefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}Ax & =b \\\\ {A}^{-1}Ax & ={A}^{-1}b \\\\ x & ={A}^{-1}b \\\\ x & ={A}^{T}b \\\\ x & =[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{5}} & \\frac{2}{\\sqrt{5}} & 0 \\\\ -\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{5}} & \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{5}} & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}\\sqrt{5} \\\\ 0 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}] \\\\ x & =[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386827 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386828 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386827 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386829 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386827 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386830 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386827 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386831 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386827 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386832 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386827 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386827 1077 "selection" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386827 1079 #edb/ref 17592186386832 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386827 1080 #uuid "e90abf70-889e-5953-a2ff-73ae3888c67c" 13194139533462 17