592186045585 true] [17592186386854 1074 "The standard equation of a left- or right-opening parabola that has its vertex at $(h,k)$ is\n\n$$\n(y-k)^{2}=4p(x-h),\n$$\n\nwhere $p$ is constant.\n\nWe can rewrite the given equation as \n\n$$\n(y+5)^{2}=4(-\\frac{1}{4})(x-2).\n$$\n\nIt is now clear that our equation is of the standard type with $p=-\\frac{1}{4}.$ \n\nComparing our equation with the standard equation, we can see that we have $h=2$ and $k=-5.$ Therefore, the coordinates of the vertex of the parabola are $(2,-5).$" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386855 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386856 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386855 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386857 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386855 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386858 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386855 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386859 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386855 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386860 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386855 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386855 1077 "selection" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386855 1079 #edb/ref 17592186386860 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386855 1080 #uuid "e066a708-3818-5b25-a57a-0121fdb30598" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386856 1081 "(\\frac{1}{4},-2)" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386856 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386856 1084 #uuid "2dc4323e-c33f-535a-afd4-6c18fb62876c" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386857 1081 "(5,-2)" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386857 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386857 1084 #uuid "2c600d3d-c6b3-5497-b45a-7300868b4cbd" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386858 1081 "(-\\frac{1}{4},-5)" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386858 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386858 1084 #uuid "e