92186386916 1071 "The velocity vector $v=⟨u,v⟩$ of a particle $P$ at time $t$ is given by\n\n$$\nv=⟨{t}^{2},\\,{e}^{2t}⟩.\n$$\n\nCalculate the acceleration vector $a.$" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386916 1072 #uuid "2ba6af89-af5f-56af-a9e0-160f4f71aca0" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386916 1074 "To compute the acceleration vector, we differentiate the velocity vector:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a & =\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}t} \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}t},\\,\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}t}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}({t}^{2}),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}({e}^{2t})⟩ \\\\  & =⟨2t,\\,2{e}^{2t}⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386917 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386918 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386917 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386919 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386917 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386920 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386917 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386921 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386917 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386922 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386917 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386917 1077 "selection" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386917 1079 #edb/ref 17592186386921 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386917 1080 #uuid "a877d503-72cd-5d28-9807-236e281f86ff" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386918 1081 "a=⟨\\frac{t}{2},\\,\\frac{{e}^{2t}}{2}⟩" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386918 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386918 1084 #uuid "6eb92dbf-5fad-5efe-b557-19b88bef10da" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386919 1081 "a=⟨2t,\\,{e}^{2t}⟩" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386919 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386919 1084 #uuid "7923ff02-537a-5c46-9034-26ed6657df17" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386920 1081 "a=⟨\\frac{t}{2},\\,\\frac{{e}^{2t}}{4}⟩" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386920 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386920 1084 #uuid "c449ee8e-b0e5-5fff-8c3d-384f4cf10aeb" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386921 1081 "a=⟨2t,\\,2{e}^{2t}⟩" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386921 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386921 1084 #uuid "72759446-2ed5-55d7-ad38-e3108b39c53a" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386922 1081 "a=⟨t,\\,{e}^{2t}⟩" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386922 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386922 1084 #uuid "c55320d0-6670-59d6-8213-9d8ccd909743" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386923 1068 #edb/ref 17592186386924 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386923 1069 "q-85606" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386923 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386923 1071 "The position vector $r(t)$ of a particle $P$ relative to a fixed origin $O$ at time $t$ is given by\n\n$$\nr(t)=⟨3{t}^{3}+t,\\,\\operatorname{ln}⁡t⟩,\\,t>0.\n$$\n\nCalculate the acceleration vector $a.$" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386923 1072 #uuid "fd766578-35eb-5e9e-b4c9-c03b5909e8a3" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386923 1074 "To compute the acceleration vector, we need to differentiate the velocity vector. So first, we need to compute the velocity vector, which we can do this by differentiating the position vector:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}v & =\\frac{\\text{d}r}{\\text{d}t} \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{\\text{d}x}{\\text{d}t},\\,\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}t}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(3{t}^{3}+t),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(\\operatorname{ln}⁡t)⟩ \\\\  & =⟨9{t}^{2}+1,\\,\\frac{1}{t}⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, to compute the acceleration vector, we differentiate the velocity vector:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a & =\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}t} \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}t},\\,\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}t}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(9{t}^{2}+1),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(\\frac{1}{t})⟩ \\\\  & =⟨18t,\\,-\\frac{1}{{t}^{2}}⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386924 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386925 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386924 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386926 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386924 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386927 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386924 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386928 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386924 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386929 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386924 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386924 1077 "selection" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386924 1079 #edb/ref 17592186386928 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386924 1080 #uuid "a517e4e9-c7f1-5c48-b08e-bfc1ef17b5e5" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386925 1081 "a=⟨18,\\,\\frac{1}{{t}^{2}}⟩" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386925 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386925 1084 #uuid "ab87df10-dd7f-5124-963d-bf4c394614d6" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386926 1081 "a=⟨18t,\\,-\\frac{2}{t}⟩" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386926 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386926 1084 #uuid "c63d9c83-e34e-558e-8ae3-fc836736d6c3" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386927 1081 "a=⟨9{t}^{2}+1,\\,\\frac{1}{t}⟩" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386927 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386927 1084 #uuid "38b37a91-571a-5339-b19f-1605a1381473" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386928 1081 "a=⟨18t,\\,-\\frac{1}{{t}^{2}}⟩" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386928 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386928 1084 #uuid "3db78a2c-6537-5296-80b7-167fd4035b5f" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386929 1081 "a=⟨9{t}^{2}+1,\\,-\\frac{1}{{t}^{2}}⟩" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386929 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386929 1084 #uuid "66b578b5-b668-5062-b023-bcdcd606cfaa" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386930 1068 #edb/ref 17592186386931 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386930 1069 "q-85609" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386930 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386930 1071 "The position vector $r$ of a particle $P$ relative to a fixed origin $O$ at time $t$ is given by\n\n$$\nr=⟨{e}^{2-t},\\,3+{t}^{4}⟩.\n$$\n\nCalculate the acceleration vector $a$ at time $t=2.$" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386930 1072 #uuid "7c35299e-e7ea-52d7-8411-4ed07a1c0894" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386930 1074 "To compute the acceleration vector, we need to differentiate the velocity vector. So first, we need to compute the velocity vector, which we can do this by differentiating the position vector:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}v & =\\frac{\\text{d}r}{\\text{d}t} \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{\\text{d}x}{\\text{d}t},\\,\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}t}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}({e}^{2-t}),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(3+{t}^{4})⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-{e}^{2-t},\\,4{t}^{3}⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, to compute the acceleration vector, we differentiate the velocity vector:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a & =\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}t} \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}t},\\,\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}t}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(-{e}^{2-t}),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(4{t}^{3})⟩ \\\\  & =⟨{e}^{2-t},\\,12{t}^{2}⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, to find the acceleration at time $t=2,$ we substitute $t=2$ into the above:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a(2) & =⟨{e}^{2-2},12(2)^{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨1,48⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386931 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386932 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386931 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386933 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386931 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386934 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386931 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386935 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386931 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386936 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386931 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386931 1077 "selection" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386931 1079 #edb/ref 17592186386936 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386931 1080 #uuid "66aac930-2d92-52fb-a347-e888b276edb6" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386932 1081 "a(2)=⟨-1,24⟩" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386932 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386932 1084 #uuid "d3eb1023-8fe9-5f8a-9ed6-e733f9b55470" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386933 1081 "a(2)=⟨0,48⟩" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386933 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386933 1084 #uuid "255a3bd0-0ade-5cd9-be87-ddbf8293d7c9" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386934 1081 "a(2)=⟨1,96⟩" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386934 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386934 1084 #uuid "bffa36e6-c392-5dbf-94e3-7f1a95af1a72" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386935 1081 "a(2)=⟨0,24⟩" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386935 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386935 1084 #uuid "865d7135-3b82-57df-a140-3dd131381f5c" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386936 1081 "a(2)=⟨1,48⟩" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386936 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386936 1084 #uuid "788dada1-a631-5db1-8aea-9bc72816dcca" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386937 1068 #edb/ref 17592186386938 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386937 1069 "q-85673" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386937 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386937 1071 "For which of the following graphs would the trapezoidal rule give an underestimate of the area under the curve between $x=-1$ and $x=1?$" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386937 1072 #uuid "0f96be30-b6f7-514c-9651-7513613567d5" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386937 1074 "The trapezoidal rule underestimates the area under the curve if the function is concave down over the given interval.     \n\nFrom the given graphs, the only curve that is concave down on $[-1,1]$ is the one shown below. \n\n![](images/a8/a8bcad7d4e90c6fdde99189026764d2b07a0709b8450252250c4fa133f5ceec0.png)" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386938 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386939 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386938 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386940 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386938 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386941 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386938 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386942 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386938 1075 #edb/ref 17592186386943 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386938 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386938 1077 "selection" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386938 1079 #edb/ref 17592186386939 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386938 1080 #uuid "35d3970a-cc00-5a7c-9ad6-6efc3dfd591c" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386939 1081 "images/a8/a8bcad7d4e90c6fdde99189026764d2b07a0709b8450252250c4fa133f5ceec0.png" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386939 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186386939 1084 #uuid "3d1e1bfa-284c-517d-a38c-1516a106df79"