icular solution of the differential equation is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{y}_{p}(x) & ={y}_{1}(x)u(x)+{y}_{2}(x)v(x),\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u(x) & =-\\int \\frac{f(x){y}_{2}(x)}{W({y}_{1},{y}_{2})}\\,\\text{d}x=-\\frac{1}{2}\\int {x}^{3}{e}^{x}\\,\\text{d}x=-\\frac{1}{2}({x}^{3}-3{x}^{2}+6x-6){e}^{x}, \\\\ v(x) & =\\int \\frac{f(x){y}_{1}(x)}{W({y}_{1},{y}_{2})}\\,\\text{d}x=\\frac{1}{2}\\int x{e}^{x}\\,\\text{d}x=\\frac{1}{2}(x-1){e}^{x}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThus,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{y}_{p}(x) & ={y}_{1}(x)u(x)+{y}_{2}(x)v(x) \\\\  & =(\\frac{1}{{x}^{3}})(-\\frac{1}{2}({x}^{3}-3{x}^{2}+6x-6){e}^{x})+(\\frac{1}{x})(\\frac{1}{2}(x-1){e}^{x}) \\\\  & =(-\\frac{1}{2}+\\frac{3}{2x}-\\frac{3}{{x}^{2}}+\\frac{3}{{x}^{3}}+\\frac{1}{2}-\\frac{1}{2x}){e}^{x} \\\\  & =(\\frac{1}{x}-\\frac{3}{{x}^{2}}+\\frac{3}{{x}^{3}}){e}^{x}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387185 1075 #edb/ref 17592186387186 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387185 1075 #edb/ref 17592186387187 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387185 1075 #edb/ref 17592186387188 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387185 1075 #edb/ref 17592186387189 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387185 1075 #edb/ref 17592186387190 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387185 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387185 1077 "selection" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387185 1079 #edb/ref 17592186387188 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387185 1080 #uuid "3f9af7bf-8e4b-52c1-9def-7c956fc990ef" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387186 1081 "{y}_{p}(x)=(\\frac{1}{x}+\\frac{1}{{x}^{2}}-\\frac{3}{{x}^{3}}){e}^{x}" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387186 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387186 1084 #uuid "bb155aa0-4397-5e09-819c-177cf354209d" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387187 1081 "{y}_{p}(x)=