he differential equation $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}={x}^{2}+x?$" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387387 1072 #uuid "33118801-2c57-5ee6-ba58-478cea588767" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387387 1074 "We have to sketch the slope field at the points $(-2,-1),(-2,-2),$ and $(1,1).$\n\nTo sketch the slope field at the given points, we substitute their coordinates into the right-hand side of the differential equation.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & {\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}|}_{(-2,-1)}=(-2)^{2}+(-2)=2, \\\\  & {\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}|}_{(-2,-2)}=(-2)^{2}+(-2)=2, \\\\  & {\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}|}_{(1,1)}=(1)^{2}+(1)=2.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSetting up our points and drawing our line segments, we get the following:\n\n![](images/21/21e88a2ac9e3c4e94e72f49e2c7635bf326b7a5ff2d8697c776e0d5eefc52b2a.png)" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387388 1075 #edb/ref 17592186387389 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387388 1075 #edb/ref 17592186387390 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387388 1075 #edb/ref 17592186387391 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387388 1075 #edb/ref 17592186387392 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387388 1075 #edb/ref 17592186387393 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387388 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387388 1077 "selection" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387388 1079 #edb/ref 17592186387389 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387388 1080 #uuid "7a468080-c61c-5081-9163-c4239c3eda35" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387389 1081 "images/21/21e88a2ac9e3c4e94e72f49e2c7635bf326b7a5ff2d8697c776e0d5eefc52b2a.png" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387389 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387389 1084 #uuid "8cd2afb2-ab4e-54aa-ba50-f2d9dc808dcc" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387390 1081 "images/64/647feb8e1004e14499e13