\nOur goal is to compute $[T]_{B}.$ Solving this equation for $[T]_{B},$ we obtain the alternative formulation\n\n$$\n[T]_{B}={P}_{C\\to B}\\cdot [T]_{C}\\cdot {P}_{C\\to B}^{-1}.\n$$\n\nFirst, we compute the inverse of ${P}_{C\\to B}:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{P}_{C\\to B}^{-1} & ={[\\begin{aligned}3 & 4 \\\\ 2 & 3\\end{aligned}]}^{-1} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{3\\cdot 3-2\\cdot 4}[\\begin{aligned}3 & -4 \\\\ -2 & 3\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}3 & -4 \\\\ -2 & 3\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we can compute the matrix of $T$ relative to the basis $C:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}[T]_{B} & ={P}_{C\\to B}\\cdot [T]_{C}\\cdot {P}_{C\\to B}^{-1} \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}3 & 4 \\\\ 2 & 3\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}2 & -4 \\\\ -2 & 3\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}3 & -4 \\\\ -2 & 3\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-2 & 0 \\\\ -2 & 1\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}3 & -4 \\\\ -2 & 3\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-6 & 8 \\\\ -8 & 11\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387464 1075 #edb/ref 17592186387465 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387464 1075 #edb/ref 17592186387466 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387464 1075 #edb/ref 17592186387467 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387464 1075 #edb/ref 17592186387468 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387464 1075 #edb/ref 17592186387469 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387464 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387464 1077 "selection" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387464 1079 #edb/ref 17592186387467 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387464 1080 #uuid "ceaa3e2d-722d-5f73-8fd9-98a8664a5416" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387465 1081 "[\\begin{aligned}-6 & -16 \\\\ 4 & 11\\end{aligned}]" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387465 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387465 1084 #uu