\n$$\n\nFinally, we find the acceleration vector at $t=\\frac{\\pi }{2},$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a(\\frac{\\pi }{2}) & =-80\\operatorname{cos}⁡(4\\cdot \\frac{\\pi }{2})\\,i-80\\operatorname{sin}⁡(4\\cdot \\frac{\\pi }{2})\\,j \\\\  & =-80\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2\\pi )\\,i-80\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2\\pi )\\,j \\\\  & =-80\\,i\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387565 1075 #edb/ref 17592186387566 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387565 1075 #edb/ref 17592186387567 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387565 1075 #edb/ref 17592186387568 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387565 1075 #edb/ref 17592186387569 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387565 1075 #edb/ref 17592186387570 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387565 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387565 1077 "selection" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387565 1079 #edb/ref 17592186387568 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387565 1080 #uuid "d30d24cc-d490-51a6-9670-d0e1ff6bece7" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387566 1081 "80\\,j" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387566 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387566 1084 #uuid "615b3966-ab34-54c4-94fb-2b6a493a05bf" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387567 1081 "-40\\,i-40\\,j" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387567 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387567 1084 #uuid "ba942577-688b-51be-af1b-e90b9481cd96" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387568 1081 "-80\\,i" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387568 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387568 1084 #uuid "2a94b620-9112-5178-8c25-19f0c2cb69b1" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387569 1081 "-80\\,i+80\\,j" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387569 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387569 1084 #uuid "32c6ee0a-9437-5374-a41d-a5b0b40cfef5" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387570 1081 "-40\\,i" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387570 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387570 1084 #uuid "c996e548-9d94-5d06-8643-4a5b9cd9f062" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387571 1068 #edb/ref 17592186387572 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387571 1069 "q-97763" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387571 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387571 1071 "The position $r,$ in meters, of a particle $P$ at time $t$ is given by $r(t)=⟨\\operatorname{cos}⁡t,\\,-\\operatorname{sin}⁡t,\\,t⟩,$ where $t$ is measured in seconds. Find the tangential component of the acceleration of $P$ at time $t=\\pi \\,\\text{s}.$" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387571 1072 #uuid "98416008-933f-5c1e-b3dd-bccbe15a9b73" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387571 1074 "The tangential component of acceleration is given by\n\n$$\n{a}_{T}=\\frac{v\\cdot a}{||v||}.\n$$\n\nFirst, we compute the velocity vector by differentiating the position vector and evaluating it at $t=\\pi ,$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}v & =⟨\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(\\operatorname{cos}⁡t),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(-\\operatorname{sin}⁡t),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(t)⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-\\operatorname{sin}⁡t,\\,-\\operatorname{cos}⁡t,\\,1⟩, \\\\ v(\\pi ) & =⟨-\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\pi ,\\,-\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\pi ,\\,1⟩ \\\\  & =⟨0,\\,1,\\,1⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNext, we compute the acceleration vector by differentiating the velocity vector and it evaluating at $t=\\pi :$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a & =⟨\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(-\\operatorname{sin}⁡t),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(-\\operatorname{cos}⁡t),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(1)⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-\\operatorname{cos}⁡t,\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡t,\\,0⟩, \\\\ a(\\pi ) & =⟨-\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\pi ,\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\pi ,\\,0⟩ \\\\  & =⟨1,\\,0,\\,0⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we compute $v(\\pi )\\cdot a(\\pi )$ and $||v(\\pi )||:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}v(\\pi )\\cdot a(\\pi ) & =⟨0,\\,1,\\,1⟩\\cdot ⟨1,\\,0,\\,0⟩ \\\\  & =0, \\\\ ||v(\\pi )|| & =\\sqrt{(0)^{2}+(1)^{2}+(1)^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we calculate the tangential component of the acceleration at $t=\\pi ,$ and we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{a}_{T} & =\\frac{v(\\pi )\\cdot a(\\pi )}{||v(\\pi )||} \\\\  & =\\frac{0}{\\sqrt{2}} \\\\  & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the tangential component of the acceleration is $0\\,{\\text{ms}}^{-2}.$" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387572 1075 #edb/ref 17592186387573 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387572 1075 #edb/ref 17592186387574 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387572 1075 #edb/ref 17592186387575 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387572 1075 #edb/ref 17592186387576 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387572 1075 #edb/ref 17592186387577 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387572 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387572 1077 "selection" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387572 1079 #edb/ref 17592186387575 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387572 1080 #uuid "7b0f922d-a304-5edb-af59-b51332258ba6" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387573 1081 "2\\,{\\text{ms}}^{-2}" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387573 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387573 1084 #uuid "98e66298-a08d-5d19-86a9-54be284c9700" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387574 1081 "1\\,{\\text{ms}}^{-2}" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387574 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387574 1084 #uuid "fc48ed15-6ee6-5a09-b4a5-0175bd5cd89c" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true]