 Therefore $y=-2,0,2$ are the equilibrium solutions of the differential equation.\n\n- $f(y)>0$ when $y\\in (-\\infty ,-2)\\cup (0,2).$\n\n- $f(y)<0$ when $y\\in (-2,0)\\cup (2,\\infty ).$\n\nTherefore, we can draw the phase line using the following recipe:\n\n- Draw a vertical $y$-axis\n\n- Mark the equilibrium solutions\n\n- Draw arrows pointing up in the intervals where $f(y)>0$\n\n- Draw arrows pointing down in the intervals where $f(y)<0$\n\nApplying the above recipe, we get the following phase line for our differential equation.\n\n![](images/66/66b90a2d1509ddb46e27d3e7164dbe1ab9b1f42aefd5df4b4482d8d2046f9bba.png)" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387585 1075 #edb/ref 17592186387586 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387585 1075 #edb/ref 17592186387587 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387585 1075 #edb/ref 17592186387588 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387585 1075 #edb/ref 17592186387589 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387585 1075 #edb/ref 17592186387590 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387585 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387585 1077 "selection" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387585 1079 #edb/ref 17592186387587 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387585 1080 #uuid "199ee9f0-5345-5f70-b0f1-4aebaf73f560" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387586 1081 "images/b2/b24f89fa181f60b0b2d6fdf1800339e1c88a2eb8da3d1ed87e0cca34140e2479.png" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387586 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387586 1084 #uuid "e39f99eb-a29f-5f06-a75e-ac4f066133f9" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387587 1081 "images/66/66b90a2d1509ddb46e27d3e7164dbe1ab9b1f42aefd5df4b4482d8d2046f9bba.png" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387587 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387587 1084 #uuid "92a1d1be-4158-5409-8ec3-45a77