 $y\\in (-1,1).$\n\nTherefore, we can draw the phase line using the following recipe:\n\n- Draw a vertical $y$-axis\n\n- Mark the equilibrium solutions\n\n- Draw arrows pointing up in the intervals where $f(y)>0$\n\n- Draw arrows pointing down in the intervals where $f(y)<0$\n\nApplying the above recipe, we get the following phase line for our differential equation.\n\n![](images/fc/fc4cd58a2c1a6e8147099455ca2439a9d7be7eb39c54f12387061bb6305e8f74.png)" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387592 1075 #edb/ref 17592186387593 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387592 1075 #edb/ref 17592186387594 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387592 1075 #edb/ref 17592186387595 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387592 1075 #edb/ref 17592186387596 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387592 1075 #edb/ref 17592186387597 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387592 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387592 1077 "selection" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387592 1079 #edb/ref 17592186387595 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387592 1080 #uuid "915e523b-9fa3-5cff-bc79-f8970bf7efda" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387593 1081 "images/cc/ccd118fa5707da5258f029a02657fc76572a217c514bdaaefdc9887ccbdcc1a7.png" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387593 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387593 1084 #uuid "f5ae3a25-6bc4-5c2f-94f5-55257f844df0" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387594 1081 "images/35/35ed4d5c01ac0ee992f0f400aec166a120d03a0b3a16392bb29be2e1a06551ec.png" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387594 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387594 1084 #uuid "d5f1775b-7743-52ec-a9ac-b164a6da7072" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387595 1081 "images/fc/fc4cd58a2c1a6e8147099455ca2439a9d7be7eb39c54f12387061bb6305e8f74.png" 13194139533462 1759218604