17592186387612 1077 "selection" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387612 1079 #edb/ref 17592186387616 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387612 1080 #uuid "7dcbea8f-b000-5d95-8095-fceedf72d8ad" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387613 1081 "images/b9/b9683bcc1b559505141d45b9007ef45011adee98b33730ffad1876a462d9abc1.png" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387613 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387613 1084 #uuid "5ac99bf6-327a-5511-b7a4-734f9c76a5be" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387614 1081 "images/80/804eac3df07358686b859f20630acc5344f82ff0c71dc80e6320ab2f7b2313f2.png" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387614 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387614 1084 #uuid "d352e845-d658-517b-b4e5-85b07a890741" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387615 1081 "images/a2/a2af9de8793d7f2e527721b3874ac6d49d25d0a1e496d3cd62ecf2710b4ab932.png" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387615 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387615 1084 #uuid "b31d701f-35d2-53fb-9bb7-6e53d677c6e4" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387616 1081 "images/c5/c52f568868328061237d43e4650180321ec4a40e886a62f4a678f0276afe821b.png" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387616 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387616 1084 #uuid "91f3d40c-2faf-5526-b31d-531299ba0057" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387617 1081 "images/40/40490df9d6ec4cc44759b0265e9355dfe6edba66028e61d6e5c36c0d839388d9.png" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387617 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387617 1084 #uuid "d4ab1f08-3af2-5eaf-b009-717e15cf1eaf" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387618 1068 #edb/ref 17592186387619 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387618 1069 "q-98018" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387618 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387618 1071 "Which of the following **cannot** be the slope field for the differential equation $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=f(y)?$" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387618 1072 #uuid "0de2f442-3f46-5398-9b0c-1c3ef935f719" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387618 1074 "Notice that we are given an equation of the form\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=f(y).\n$$\n\nThis is an autonomous equation because the right-hand side is a function of $y$ only. This means that, for a fixed value of $y,$ the slope does not vary with $x.$ \n\nOf the given slope fields, the only one that varies with $x$ for a fixed value of $y$ is the following:\n\n  \n\n![](images/9f/9f883ac23f1a6574f2afdf2ca4dcb0aaf617c992c6c67f34ca5d3a0af63b8149.png)\n\n \n\nTo see this more clearly, notice that if we draw a horizontal line, the slopes touching the line vary as we go left and right along the line. \n\n![](images/b1/b157285c42bd83c28ed4b3da51fa6d0e83353ae806781fd4231abd45da880228.png)" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387619 1075 #edb/ref 17592186387620 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387619 1075 #edb/ref 17592186387621 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387619 1075 #edb/ref 17592186387622 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387619 1075 #edb/ref 17592186387623 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387619 1075 #edb/ref 17592186387624 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387619 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387619 1077 "selection" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387619 1079 #edb/ref 17592186387621 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387619 1080 #uuid "b5762e36-ba81-55a2-b948-5565b0e2ebbe" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387620 1081 "images/2d/2d6e60649a74a2962207052bcd6e4af075e3c1a2274459b809e9ddd85401234b.png" 13194139533462 17592186045585 t