db/ref 17592186387634 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387631 1075 #edb/ref 17592186387635 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387631 1075 #edb/ref 17592186387636 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387631 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387631 1077 "selection" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387631 1079 #edb/ref 17592186387632 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387631 1080 #uuid "178eecae-8495-5623-a528-d940d6a47162" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387632 1081 "images/9f/9fc470d0d317379f32576f92d9c16dc51e24184b448d11280193b949c08bee26.png" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387632 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387632 1084 #uuid "79d91382-9ab5-5467-a190-6adaf8506b75" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387633 1081 "images/ea/eaefe01eb97b7f03d9ca24f47263201b22b87cdb0453b98c65f07693f5afe741.png" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387633 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387633 1084 #uuid "87481517-9502-5307-8715-a2439483b0be" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387634 1081 "images/2c/2cb6c81ea87d7299083a853f94f4238ce074b9ca553fa142bc3ef0b68f1a11fe.png" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387634 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387634 1084 #uuid "ff7ba7a8-4b26-574e-aee8-2abdcfb69227" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387635 1081 "images/e2/e2053309347d1a471b449745106de45c5932a9f6fed737a08a8150353f2b589a.png" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387635 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387635 1084 #uuid "86bfb78b-8a3f-5bd8-bfe6-610461977ef2" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387636 1081 "images/07/07e822b78317e1bc18b5b7060ac867a200b60403ffe0b91eadad850efe865d55.png" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387636 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387636 1084 #uuid "04c399f1-df31-56df-9b13-7e3645c989ed" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387637 1068 #edb/ref 17592186387638 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387637 1069 "q-98040" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387637 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387637 1071 "![](images/58/58369eb9878aba12bf52d22a930ec348e7b6cf31e1b2c8d77823de1aab5d9c87.png)\n\nThe slope field of the differential equation $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=f(y)$ is shown above. Which of the following is the phase line of the given equation?" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387637 1072 #uuid "4b7cd7a6-7b0b-599b-8ee5-35ee0fead25b" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387637 1074 "From the slope field, we can deduce the following:\n\n- $y=-2$ and $y=0$ are equilibrium solutions.\n\n- For all $y\\in (0,\\infty ),$ the slopes of the slope field are negative. Therefore, $f(y)<0$ in this region.\n\n- For all $y\\in (-\\infty ,-2)\\cup (-2,0),$ the slopes of the slope field are positive. Therefore, $f(y)>0$ in this region.\n\nNow, we can draw the phase line using the following recipe:\n\n- Draw a vertical $y$-axis\n\n- Mark the equilibrium solutions\n\n- Draw arrows pointing up in the intervals where $f(y)>0$\n\n- Draw arrows pointing down in the intervals where $f(y)<0$\n\nApplying the above recipe, we get the following phase line for our differential equation.\n\n![](images/fc/fcc9f998111493167284cf5844645ac2201a230b073a9336604fb790ba16bad4.png)" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387638 1075 #edb/ref 17592186387639 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387638 1075 #edb/ref 17592186387640 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387638 1075 #edb/ref 17592186387641 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387638 1075 #edb/ref 17592186387642 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387638 1075 #edb/ref 17592186387643 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387638 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387638 1077 "selection" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387638 1079 #edb/ref 17592186387639 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387638 1080 #uuid "d3886a20-26e5-5d0d-8212-68a6f5c3b23c" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387639 1081 "images/f2/f22dc056accfeae38eea6fb0207adfe4676bd8bd875cbeb96c078f4eb6457a6e.png" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387639 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387639 1084 #uuid "e4cd8f6e-8e9e-5d1a-8066-cff45cc5c439" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387640 1081 "images/03/03d9436c922b602b3e3388dfc21b6e8c20aae96f70b378de706b3c96b7ded253.png" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387640 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387640 1084 #uuid "86d3d9ca-462f-5031-9d54-732cd069f3c2" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387641 1081 "images/f9/f95aa207248151fc7035fcd6dcdea8de58ebff368aa886b18413249bf30225ba.png" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387641 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387641 1084 #uuid "7c8b0bc1-7323-5059-821f-b7086cffa967" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387642 1081 "images/86/86bcece5228ba30310e4b4ed663c5efcb551609474fa924034efac08aa055a23.png" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387642 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387642 1084 #uuid "adc0e2fb-f40c-57d8-9565-f8f1f6f4126d" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387643 1081 "images/d4/d46036d0f5c0fc689d1123e3512a446b94688f6fa94df017ee26682860ed6b64.png" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387643 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387643 1084 #uuid "66855340-dfe3-5a08-b59e-3afbf9393ed6" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387644 1068 #edb/ref 17592186387645 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387644 1069 "q-98042" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387644 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387644 1071 "![](images/d4/d4aac304110ed4743b58ba786141cecc404791130bf35884f8fbefe94c18fbd6.png)\n\nThe phase line of a differential equation $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=f(y)$ is shown above. Which of the following could be the slope field of the equation?" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387644 1072 #uuid "c73ad3e7-b3ca-5ad8-bbdd-651ca41243b4" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387644 1074 "From the phase line, we can deduce the following:\n\n- The equilibrium solutions are $y=-2$ and $y=2.$ Therefore, the slopes of the slope field are horizontal along these lines.\n\n- $f(y)<0$ for $y\\in (-2,2).$ Therefore, the slopes of the slope field are negative in this region.\n\n- $f(y)>0$ for $y\\in (-\\infty ,-2)\\cup (2,\\infty ).$ Therefore, the slopes of the slope field are positive in these regions.\n\nThe only slope field that satisfies the above conditions is the following.\n\n![](images/eb/eb76b700066be49d493fe0738b7c3b18b0b34dcaada93f7c961e5647a0a079c1.png)" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387645 1075 #edb/ref 17592186387646 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387645 1075 #edb/ref 17592186387647 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387645 1075 #edb/ref 17592186387648 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387645 1075 #edb/ref 17592186387649 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387645 1075 #edb/ref 17592186387650 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387645 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387645 1077 "selection" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387645 1079 #edb/ref 17592186387646 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387645 1080 #uuid "8c074343-5a30-5107-89fc-6888e42071ad" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186