xt{d}x}=f(y)$ is shown above. Which of the following could be the slope field of the equation?" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387651 1072 #uuid "39428345-6748-536d-b2d2-34a2351fb0b9" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387651 1074 "From the phase line, we can deduce the following:\n\n- The equilibrium solutions are $y=-1$ and $y=3.$ Therefore, the slopes of the slope field are horizontal along these lines.\n\n- $f(y)<0$ for $y\\in (-\\infty ,-1)\\cup (3,\\infty ).$ Therefore, the slopes of the slope field are negative in these regions.\n\n- $f(y)>0$ for $y\\in (-1,3).$ Therefore, the slopes of the slope field are positive in this region.\n\nThe only slope field that satisfies the above conditions is the following.\n\n![](images/82/828432bf3e1afdb2d2e377d7d8af3272d765956120ce8aeaf5674fefa31365fd.png)" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387652 1075 #edb/ref 17592186387653 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387652 1075 #edb/ref 17592186387654 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387652 1075 #edb/ref 17592186387655 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387652 1075 #edb/ref 17592186387656 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387652 1075 #edb/ref 17592186387657 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387652 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387652 1077 "selection" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387652 1079 #edb/ref 17592186387655 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387652 1080 #uuid "88f5dd83-c7a9-549b-9a09-830f674abb50" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387653 1081 "images/4c/4c51f6816ac20a822801ecf19cabdc13b251c9e06a97d990a5db48b4c4395c38.png" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387653 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387653 1084 #uuid "b045456b-0ff9-58d2-8f14-e76187abf90f" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387654 1081 "images/2a/2a531703c3531413694697613a0c7448a3808