n on the known result:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{3}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t & =-{\\int }_{3}^{0}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =-⟨5,\\,-1,\\,-2⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-5,\\,1,\\,2⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, applying the vector addition rule, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{3}f(t)+⟨-1,\\,1,\\,-1⟩\\,\\text{d}t & ={\\int }_{0}^{3}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t+{\\int }_{0}^{3}⟨-1,\\,1,\\,-1⟩\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =⟨-5,\\,1,\\,2⟩+{⟨-t,\\,t,\\,-t⟩|}_{0}^{3} \\\\  & =⟨-5,\\,1,\\,2⟩+⟨-3,\\,3,\\,-3⟩\\text{ } \\\\  & =⟨-8,\\,4,\\,-1⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387700 1075 #edb/ref 17592186387701 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387700 1075 #edb/ref 17592186387702 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387700 1075 #edb/ref 17592186387703 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387700 1075 #edb/ref 17592186387704 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387700 1075 #edb/ref 17592186387705 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387700 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387700 1077 "selection" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387700 1079 #edb/ref 17592186387703 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387700 1080 #uuid "41b5d00f-231c-5d5e-9824-656cae587369" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387701 1081 "⟨-8,\\,2,\\,1⟩" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387701 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387701 1084 #uuid "6f78597b-fe94-5d3b-a150-9662a2903e53" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387702 1081 "⟨8,\\,4,\\,1⟩" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387702 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387702 1084 #uuid "54233a06-2e66-5ab0-bfb0-15ca60c09e48" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387703 1081 "⟨-8,\\,4,\\,-1⟩" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387703 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387703