\operatorname{sin}⁡t-\\operatorname{cos}⁡t⟩}{(\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{\\sqrt{3}})}=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}⟨\\operatorname{cos}⁡t-\\operatorname{sin}⁡t,\\,0,\\,-\\operatorname{sin}⁡t-\\operatorname{cos}⁡t⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we calculate the binormal vector, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}B(t) & =T(t)\\times N(t) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}⟨\\operatorname{cos}⁡t+\\operatorname{sin}⁡t,1,\\operatorname{cos}⁡t-\\operatorname{sin}⁡t⟩\\times \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}⟨\\operatorname{cos}⁡t-\\operatorname{sin}⁡t,\\,0,\\,-\\operatorname{sin}⁡t-\\operatorname{cos}⁡t⟩ \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{6}}\\,\\left|\\begin{aligned}i & j & k \\\\ \\operatorname{cos}⁡t+\\operatorname{sin}⁡t & 1 & \\operatorname{cos}⁡t-\\operatorname{sin}⁡t \\\\ \\operatorname{cos}⁡t-\\operatorname{sin}⁡t & 0 & -\\operatorname{sin}⁡t-\\operatorname{cos}⁡t\\end{aligned}\\right| \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{6}}[\\text{ }\\left|\\begin{aligned}1 & \\operatorname{cos}⁡t-\\operatorname{sin}⁡t \\\\ 0 & -\\operatorname{sin}⁡t-\\operatorname{cos}⁡t\\end{aligned}\\right|\\,i-\\left|\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{cos}⁡t+\\operatorname{sin}⁡t & \\operatorname{cos}⁡t-\\operatorname{sin}⁡t \\\\ \\operatorname{cos}⁡t-\\operatorname{sin}⁡t & -\\operatorname{sin}⁡t-\\operatorname{cos}⁡t\\end{aligned}\\right|\\,j+\\left|\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{cos}⁡t+\\operatorname{sin}⁡t & 1 \\\\ \\operatorname{cos}⁡t-\\operatorname{sin}⁡t & 0\\end{aligned}\\right|\\,k\\text{ }] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{6}}⟨-\\operatorname{sin}⁡t-\\operatorname{cos}⁡t-0,-(-(\\operatorname{sin}⁡t+\\operatorname{cos}⁡t)^{2}-(\\operatorname{cos}⁡t-\\operatorname{sin}⁡t)^{2}),-(\\operatorname{cos}⁡t-\\operatorname{sin}⁡t)⟩ \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{6}}⟨-\\operatorname{sin}⁡t-\\operatorname{cos}⁡t,(\\operatorname{sin}⁡t+\\operatorname{cos}⁡t)^{2}+(\\operatorname{cos}⁡t-\\operatorname{sin}⁡t)^{2},\\operatorname{sin}⁡t-\\operatorname{cos}⁡t⟩ \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{6}}⟨-\\operatorname{sin}⁡t-\\operatorname{cos}⁡t,\\,2,\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡t-\\operatorname{cos}⁡t⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387935 1075 #edb/ref 17592186387936 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387935 1075 #edb/ref 17592186387937 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387935 1075 #edb/ref 17592186387938 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387935 1075 #edb/ref 17592186387939 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387935 1075 #edb/ref 17592186387940 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387935 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387935 1077 "selection" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387935 1079 #edb/ref 17592186387939 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387935 1080 #uuid "ff474b43-5d6a-5b7a-a58e-1b2570cb72d5" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387936 1081 "\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}⟨-\\operatorname{sin}⁡t-\\operatorname{cos}⁡t,\\,0,\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡t-\\operatorname{cos}⁡t⟩" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387936 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387936 1084 #uuid "653e27c5-93b9-5b8b-a566-b9feceda02bd" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387937 1081 "\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}⟨0,\\,2,\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡t-\\operatorname{cos}⁡t⟩" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387937 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387937 1084 #uuid "5794d3a1-89b4-5773-b8c5-d7d54c7628e6" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387938 1081 "\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}⟨\\operatorname{sin}⁡t+\\operatorname{cos}⁡t,\\,-1,\\,\\operatorname{cos}⁡t-\\operatorname{sin}⁡t⟩" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387938 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387938 1084 #uuid "4cce8c74-35bc-56c3-8c51-9d331c6a850c" 13194139533462 17592186045585 true] [17592186387939 1081 "\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{6}}⟨-\\operatorname{sin}⁡t-\\operatorname{cos}⁡t,\\,2,\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡t-\\operatorname{cos}⁡t⟩" 1319413953